":"I'm... a little dizzy..."},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"It's... fine."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Miss Misha, how long have you been in Lungmen?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"About... a week."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Just one week...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"Mm... A lot of strange people appeared in the city... and then..."},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"I'm not sure what happened... Everyone started fleeing, so I also..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It was Reunion... Reunion attacked Chernobog."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"I don't know."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Were you... Infected before?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_012_misa_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"I... I don't know..."},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"But these last few days, these things... began growing on my leg."},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"I..."},{"t":"line","name":"Misha","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":3,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Misha? Misha? !"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_